<title>POLAND: Drosed to move to main market on May 5.</title>
<headline>Drosed to move to main market on May 5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish poultry producer Drosed SA will move to the main market of the Warsaw bourse from the parallel market on May 5, Drosed said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The parallel market lists smaller, less liquid firms or those which have not been reporting earnings results long enough.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
